        "slc_ed953129bfe67267a07040d26954d9328db3fc322eb60d97fbbfe167b677474e"
      ],
      "text": "The project is a Python coding-agent runtime whose main.py provides a prompt_toolkit CLI, with core.engine.AgentEngine running an autonomous task-driven loop and core.task.TaskManager tracking pending, in-progress, completed, and skipped tasks."
    },
    {
