      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_71dd372b7ea3b47521a80716296033a8b2836b76d27378c4477735ab10e43210"
      ],
      "text": "The CLI exposes slash commands for custom-agent management (/agent create, list, use, preview, edit, delete) and lets users invoke a specialist agent inline via @AgentName syntax."
    },
